{"id":"vd-a2-vote-for-nadia","level":"a2","n":61,"title":{"en":"If I Win, I'll…","vi":"Nếu tớ thắng, tớ sẽ…"},"summary":"Tối trước ngày bầu cử, Nadia tập bài phát biểu trước Ellis; Ellis đóng vai một bạn học khó tính và hỏi dồn.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-vote-for-nadia","level":"a2","title":{"en":"Vote for Nadia","vi":"Hãy bầu cho Nadia"}},"scene":{"background":"classroom","props":[{"id":"microphone","x":800}]},"cast":{"nadia":{"name":{"en":"Nadia","vi":"Nadia"},"look":"teengirl","x":520,"style":{"hair":"bun","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#C68E6A","skinShade":"#AD7654","outfit":"uniform","top":"#2E7D6B","topShade":"#246657"}},"ellis":{"name":{"en":"Ellis","vi":"Ellis"},"look":"teenboy","x":1150,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#D9B26F","outfit":"uniform","top":"#2E7D6B","topShade":"#246657"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"ellis","en":"OK, candidate Nadia. Why should I vote for you?","vi":"Được rồi, ứng cử viên Nadia. Tại sao tớ nên bầu cho cậu?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","ˈkændədeɪt","ˈnædjə","waɪ","ʃʊd","aɪ","voʊt","fɔɹ","ju"],"start":0.554,"end":4.634,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.243],[2,1.786],[3,3.326],[4,3.611],[5,3.801],[6,3.883],[7,4.155],[8,4.386]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Because I listen. I asked everybody about our school.","vi":"Vì tớ biết lắng nghe. Tớ đã hỏi mọi người về trường mình.","ipa":["bɪˈkɔz","aɪ","ˈlɪsən","aɪ","æskt","ˈɛvɹiˌbɑdi","əˈbaʊt","ˈaʊɚ","skul"],"start":5.424,"end":9.544,"expression":"shy","prop":"microphone","timing":[[0,5.424],[1,5.791],[2,5.932],[3,7.4],[4,7.591],[5,8.037],[6,8.611],[7,8.943],[8,9.083]]},{"speaker":"ellis","en":"Louder, please! I can't hear you at the back.","vi":"To lên nào! Ngồi cuối lớp tớ không nghe thấy.","ipa":["ˈlaʊdɚ","pliz","aɪ","kænt","hiɹ","ju","æt","ðə","bæk"],"start":10.334,"end":14.334,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,10.334],[1,11.077],[2,12.726],[3,12.916],[4,13.255],[5,13.5],[6,13.649],[7,13.772],[8,13.867]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Because I listen!","vi":"Vì tớ biết lắng nghe!","ipa":["bɪˈkɔz","aɪ","ˈlɪsən"],"start":15.124,"end":16.194,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,15.124],[1,15.491],[2,15.619]]},{"speaker":"ellis","en":"Better. So, what will you do if you win?","vi":"Khá hơn rồi. Vậy cậu sẽ làm gì nếu thắng?","ipa":["ˈbɛtɚ","soʊ","wʌt","wɪl","ju","du","ɪf","ju","wɪn"],"start":16.984,"end":20.474,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,16.984],[1,18.37],[2,19.077],[3,19.28],[4,19.416],[5,19.579],[6,19.81],[7,19.946],[8,20.082]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"If I win, I'll ask for a quiet room in the library.","vi":"Nếu tớ thắng, tớ sẽ đề nghị có một phòng yên tĩnh trong thư viện.","ipa":["ɪf","aɪ","wɪn","aɪl","æsk","fɔɹ","ə","ˈkwaɪət","ɹum","ɪn","ðə","ˈlaɪbɹɛˌɹi"],"start":21.264,"end":24.834,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,21.264],[1,21.412],[2,21.565],[3,22.203],[4,22.419],[5,22.764],[6,22.981],[7,23.057],[8,23.567],[9,23.861],[10,24.014],[11,24.129]]},{"speaker":"ellis","en":"Marcus says he'll give us pizza every week.","vi":"Marcus nói cậu ấy sẽ cho bọn mình ăn pizza hằng tuần.","ipa":["ˈmɑɹkəs","sɛz","hil","ɡɪv","ʌs","ˈpitsə","ˈɛvɚi","wik"],"start":25.624,"end":28.174,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,25.624],[1,26.072],[2,26.357],[3,26.534],[4,26.751],[5,26.928],[6,27.431],[7,27.743]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"I won't promise pizza. I can't pay for it!","vi":"Tớ sẽ không hứa pizza đâu. Tớ đâu có tiền trả!","ipa":["aɪ","woʊnt","ˈpɹɑməs","ˈpitsə","aɪ","kænt","peɪ","fɔɹ","ɪt"],"start":28.964,"end":32.674,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,28.964],[1,29.071],[2,29.402],[3,29.9],[4,31.355],[5,31.534],[6,31.929],[7,32.197],[8,32.529]]},{"speaker":"ellis","en":"Ha! Fair. What else?","vi":"Ha! Công bằng. Còn gì nữa?","ipa":["hɑ","fɛɹ","wʌt","ɛls"],"start":33.464,"end":37.084,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,33.464],[1,34.82],[2,36.355],[3,36.6]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"If you vote for me, I'll ask the school to fix the lockers.","vi":"Nếu các bạn bầu cho tớ, tớ sẽ đề nghị nhà trường sửa tủ đồ.","ipa":["ɪf","ju","voʊt","fɔɹ","mi","aɪl","æsk","ðə","skul","tu","fɪks","ðə","ˈlɑkɚz"],"start":37.874,"end":41.654,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,37.874],[1,37.986],[2,38.152],[3,38.458],[4,38.662],[5,39.198],[6,39.453],[7,39.772],[8,39.887],[9,40.346],[10,40.486],[11,40.831],[12,40.958]]},{"speaker":"ellis","en":"And the new students? They don't know anyone.","vi":"Còn các bạn mới thì sao? Họ chẳng quen ai cả.","ipa":["ənd","ðə","nu","ˈstudənts","ðeɪ","doʊnt","noʊ","ˈɛniˌwʌn"],"start":42.444,"end":45.794,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,42.444],[1,42.535],[2,42.644],[3,42.847],[4,44.537],[5,44.727],[6,44.971],[7,45.175]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"I'll start a lunch club for them. I promise.","vi":"Tớ sẽ lập một câu lạc bộ ăn trưa cho họ. Tớ hứa đấy.","ipa":["aɪl","stɑɹt","ə","lʌntʃ","klʌb","fɔɹ","ðɛm","aɪ","ˈpɹɑməs"],"start":46.584,"end":50.334,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,46.584],[1,46.747],[2,47.104],[3,47.194],[4,47.627],[5,47.984],[6,48.201],[7,49.414],[8,49.58]]},{"speaker":"ellis","en":"What will you do if you lose?","vi":"Cậu sẽ làm gì nếu thua?","ipa":["wʌt","wɪl","ju","du","ɪf","ju","luz"],"start":51.124,"end":52.554,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,51.124],[1,51.273],[2,51.409],[3,51.558],[4,51.789],[5,51.925],[6,52.061]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"If I lose, I'll start the club anyway.","vi":"Nếu thua, tớ vẫn sẽ lập câu lạc bộ.","ipa":["ɪf","aɪ","luz","aɪl","stɑɹt","ðə","klʌb","ˈɛniˌweɪ"],"start":53.344,"end":55.954,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,53.344],[1,53.492],[2,53.645],[3,54.41],[4,54.576],[5,54.959],[6,55.086],[7,55.418]]},{"speaker":"ellis","en":"Then I'll vote for you. And I'll tell everybody.","vi":"Vậy thì tớ sẽ bầu cho cậu. Và tớ sẽ nói với tất cả mọi người.","ipa":["ðɛn","aɪl","voʊt","fɔɹ","ju","ənd","aɪl","tɛl","ˈɛvɹiˌbɑdi"],"start":56.744,"end":60.134,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","react":{"nadia":"happy"},"timing":[[0,56.744],[1,56.971],[2,57.134],[3,57.392],[4,57.623],[5,58.864],[6,59.068],[7,59.203],[8,59.53]]}],"words":[{"id":"promise","en":"promise","ip